  "response_text": "HAL acts as the layer that directly configures the hardware and provides them as libraries and functions for us to use, so instead of directly working with the hardware, we can now simply call a function to help us do so using HAL. The consist of high level functions that lets developers interact with hardware components like GPIO, UART and timers, without the need to configure the hardware registers.\\nQuestion\\nIn your own words, explain what the __io_putchar function does and why it is needed.",
